5. spatialai_data_utils stub  (third_party/spatialai_data_utils/)
-----------------------------------------------------------------
    Minimal local stand-in for an NVIDIA-internal utility package that the TAO
    Sparse4D dataloader imports but whose functionality is unnecessary for
    inference. Written by us, MIT-licensed, and INCLUDED in this repository. It
    contains no NVIDIA code — only the small set of symbols the import path
    requires.


